9. Having considered the aforesaid facts and circumstances of the case and keeping in view the fact that the F.I.R was lodged five months after the alleged incident and the applicant was named for the first time in the additional statement of the informant after six months after lodging of an F.I.R.;
that Rs. 80,000/- has been paid to the co-accused's firm through banking channel regarding which a cash memo was issued by the co-accused's firm, coupled with the fact that four co-accused persons have already been granted bail and the applicant is languishing in jail since 02.08.2023 and without making any observations which may affect the merits of the case, I am of the view that the aforesaid facts are sufficient for making out a case for enlargement of the applicant on bail.
10.

